cctext patch 0003: clamp texture and gradient coordinates before integer
conversion.

A texture (a pattern tile, an image, a group or mask canvas) translated
by 1e38, or drawn far smaller than its pixels, made (int)(v * 65536)
undefined in the blenders, and blend_untransformed_argb computed
0 - INT_MIN (fuzz, UBSan). Texture offsets clamp to +-2^30 (NaN -> 0);
the transformed blenders step in 64-bit fixed point from values clamped
to +-2^46; gradient positions clamp to +-2^30 before the colour-table
lookup. Pixel lookups were already bounds-checked (or wrapped); this
removes the undefined arithmetic.

Apply after 0002.

--- a/source/plutovg-blend.c
+++ b/source/plutovg-blend.c
